--[[
    Auto Piano Scanner v7
    - "A" button (right side)  -> show / hide the music panel
    - Tap a song = play it. Tap the star on a row = pin it (saved between sessions)
    - Progress bar: drag to seek.  |<  -10  Play/Pause  +10  >|
    - Speed − / + changes tempo in REAL TIME (tap the number to reset to 1.0x)
    - AUTO button: Off / Next (plays every song in the list one after another) / One (repeat) / Shuffle
    - ★ button next to search = show pinned songs only,  ⚙ = mode settings
    - Search: type to filter, press ENTER to also search BitMidi online
    - Scanner box keeps scanning + playing even while the panel is hidden ("BOX" = show/hide box visuals)

    Song sources: NanoMIDI, GitHub repos (GITHUB_REPOS below), your own files in
    workspace/AutoPiano/*.mid, and BitMidi search.

    NEW in v7:
    - 🎼 button (next to ⚙): paste a YouTube link or type a song name -> Opennan turns it into MIDI,
      saves it in workspace/AutoPiano/ and plays it. Free: 3 songs/day per IP. Takes ~1-2x the song length.
    - Time-synced lyrics (LRCLIB) shown under the song title when found. Toggle in ⚙.
      Lyrics are searched with the song title, so name your songs "Title - Artist" for best results.
]]
local __ok, __err = xpcall(function()

